# Day 5 - Context Engineering

## What I Learned

Context Engineering improves AI outputs by providing detailed background information instead of relying on generic prompts.

## Experiment

### Prompt A
Generic AI Engineer roadmap request.

### Result
Received a generic roadmap applicable to anyone.

### Prompt B
Provided personal profile, skills, goals, timeline, and constraints.

### Result
Received a personalized AI Engineer roadmap aligned with my current Reporting Analyst role and Data Analytics background.

## Key Insight

The quality of AI output is directly proportional to the quality of context provided.

Prompt Engineering asks better questions.

Context Engineering provides better information.

## Real-World Applications

- AI Agents
- Career Planning
- Project Planning
- Business Strategy
- Personalized Learning
